program.

00:01:31.340 --> 00:01:37.180
Axios reporting January six committee requests
Sean Hannity's cooperation.

00:01:37.180 --> 00:01:42.380
They have requested Fox News Channel host
Sean Hannity voluntarily voluntarily cooperate

00:01:42.380 --> 00:01:43.380
with the investigation.

00:01:43.380 --> 00:01:47.640
Hannity is one of the most prominent media
figures in America, was a close adviser to

00:01:47.640 --> 00:01:49.860
Trump throughout his presidency.

00:01:49.860 --> 00:01:53.530
The committee revealed last month that Hannity
texted then White House Chief of Staff Mark

00:01:53.530 --> 00:01:59.810
Meadows during the riot to urge him to get
Trump to stop his supporters.

00:01:59.810 --> 00:02:03.109
