be arrested or prosecuted.

00:02:06.990 --> 00:02:11.520
But Hannity has never criticized Trump for
his role in ginning up the crowd in D.C. that

00:02:11.520 --> 00:02:17.510
day, and he has criticized the congressional
committee investigating Jan. six article from

00:02:17.510 --> 00:02:23.890
The Daily Beast revealed Sean Hannity's other
